#: plugin_katetextfilter.cpp:188
msgid "You are not allowed to execute arbitrary external applications. If you want to be able to do this, contact your system administrator."
msgstr "Du muttst keen extern Programmen utföhren. Wenn Du dit liekers wullt, snack dor bitte Dien Systeempleger op an."

